        <ul style="margin:0 0 8px 18px; font-size:0.85rem; line-height:1.4;">
            <li>Total no. of patients OPD in hospital (Monthly): <b>3,594 (3,398 OPD + 196 Casualty/IPD)</b></li>
            <li>Total no. of X-Ray done (Monthly): <b>${s.total}</b></li>
            <li>Total no. of CT Scan done (Monthly): <b>N/A (Facility not available at RH level)</b></li>
            <li>Prescription / referral slip verification status:
                <ul style="margin-left:15px; list-style-type:circle;">
                    <li>Patient details (Name, Age, Sex, Reported allergy, Date of consultation): <b>Verified & Complete (100%)</b></li>
                    <li>Contact No. of patient: <b>Verified & Complete (100%)</b></li>
                    <li>Test name & Emergency / Non-Emergency tagging (as per MoU Clause 1.11): <b>Verified & Tagged Properly (100%)</b></li>
                    <li>Signature of Prescribing / Referring Doctor: <b>Verified & Available (100%)</b></li>
                    <li>Signature of Medical Superintendent / Institute Head: <b>Verified & Signed (100%)</b></li>
                </ul>
            </li>
        </ul>

        <h4 style="color:#0B3D91; background:#f0f9ff; padding:4px 8px; border-left:4px solid #0B3D91; margin:10px 0 6px 0; font-size:0.92rem;">2. Sample Size</h4>
        <p style="font-size:0.85rem; margin:0 0 6px 10px;">• Population (Monthly referrals for X-Ray): <b>${s.total}</b><br>
