        <h4 style="color:#0B3D91; background:#f0f9ff; padding:4px 8px; border-left:4px solid #0B3D91; margin:10px 0 6px 0; font-size:0.92rem;">3. Data Collection</h4>
        <p style="font-size:0.85rem; margin:0 0 6px 10px;">• Sampling Technique: Simple random sampling technique used.<br>
        • Distribution: Half of the sample (33) taken from first two weeks and half (33) from remaining two weeks.</p>

        <h4 style="color:#0B3D91; background:#f0f9ff; padding:4px 8px; border-left:4px solid #0B3D91; margin:10px 0 6px 0; font-size:0.92rem;">4. Timeliness of Reporting (as per MoU Clause 1.11 & Annexure-B)</h4>
        <ul style="margin:0 0 8px 18px; font-size:0.85rem; line-height:1.4;">
