            <li>Non-emergency/routine cases (12 Hours TAT): <b>${rtCompliance}% reported within TAT</b> (${s.rtOntime} out of ${s.rtTotal} cases).</li>
            <li>Overall Reporting Timeliness: <b>${s.overallCompliance}% compliant</b>.</li>
            <li>Shortfall / Deduction: <b>Nil (0% penalty applicable)</b></li>
        </ul>

